{"n":93,"name":"Ad-Duhaa","nameAr":"الضحى","meaning":"The Morning Hours","ayahs":11,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","en":"By the morning brightness","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","tr":"wal-ḍuḥā","en":"By the morning brightness","root":"ضحو","lem":"ضُحًى"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","en":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"wa-al-layli","en":"And the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"سَجَىٰ","tr":"sajā","en":"it covers with darkness","root":"سجو","lem":"سَجَى"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","en":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muḥammad], nor has He detested [you].","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"وَدَّعَكَ","tr":"waddaʿaka","en":"has forsaken you","root":"ودع","lem":"وَدَّعَ"},{"ar":"رَبُّكَ","tr":"rabbuka","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"قَلَىٰ","tr":"qalā","en":"He is displeased","root":"قلي","lem":"قَلَى"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","en":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","w":[{"ar":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","tr":"walalākhiratu","en":"And surely the Hereafter","root":"أخر","lem":"آخِر"},{"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","tr":"khayrun","en":"(is) better","root":"خير","lem":"خَيْر"},{"ar":"لَّكَ","tr":"laka","en":"for you"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"than"},{"ar":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","tr":"l-ūlā","en":"the first","root":"أول","lem":"أَوَّل"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","en":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَسَوْفَ","tr":"walasawfa","en":"And soon"},{"ar":"يُعْطِيكَ","tr":"yuʿ'ṭīka","en":"will give you","root":"عطو","lem":"أَعْطَى"},{"ar":"رَبُّكَ","tr":"rabbuka","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","tr":"fatarḍā","en":"then you will be satisfied","root":"رضو","lem":"رَضِيَ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","en":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?","w":[{"ar":"أَلَمْ","tr":"alam","en":"Did not"},{"ar":"يَجِدْكَ","tr":"yajid'ka","en":"He find you","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"يَتِيمًۭا","tr":"yatīman","en":"an orphan","root":"يتم","lem":"يَتِيم"},{"ar":"فَـَٔاوَىٰ","tr":"faāwā","en":"and give shelter","root":"أوي","lem":"آوَى"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّا فَهَدَىٰ","en":"And He found you lost and guided [you],","w":[{"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ","tr":"wawajadaka","en":"And He found you","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"ضَآلًّۭا","tr":"ḍāllan","en":"lost","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضالّ"},{"ar":"فَهَدَىٰ","tr":"fahadā","en":"so He guided","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ","en":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient.","w":[{"ar":"وَوَجَدَكَ","tr":"wawajadaka","en":"And He found you","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"عَآئِلًۭا","tr":"ʿāilan","en":"in need","root":"عيل","lem":"عائِل"},{"ar":"فَأَغْنَىٰ","tr":"fa-aghnā","en":"so He made self-sufficient","root":"غني","lem":"أَغْنَى"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","en":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","w":[{"ar":"فَأَمَّا","tr":"fa-ammā","en":"So as for"},{"ar":"ٱلْيَتِيمَ","tr":"l-yatīma","en":"the orphan","root":"يتم","lem":"يَتِيم"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"then (do) not"},{"ar":"تَقْهَرْ","tr":"taqhar","en":"oppress","root":"قهر","lem":"تَقْهَرْ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","en":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"And as for"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّآئِلَ","tr":"l-sāila","en":"one who asks","root":"سأل","lem":"سائِل"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"then (do) not"},{"ar":"تَنْهَرْ","tr":"tanhar","en":"repel","root":"نهر","lem":"تَنْهَرْ"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","en":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"But as for"},{"ar":"بِنِعْمَةِ","tr":"biniʿ'mati","en":"(the) Favor","root":"نعم","lem":"نِعْمَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَحَدِّثْ","tr":"faḥaddith","en":"narrate","root":"حدث","lem":"تُحَدِّثُ"}]}]}